WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.690
<c.running>About sixty years after the first</c>

2
00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.890
<c.running>night, by our running count,</c>

3
00:00:05.942 --> 00:00:08.903
<c.fact>a draftsman goes live and re-issues his</c>

4
00:00:08.903 --> 00:00:12.345
<c.fact>whole drawing set for a city on the Moon.</c>

5
00:00:12.727 --> 00:00:15.339
<c.fact>At the first ISSUED stamp, the picture</c>

6
00:00:15.339 --> 00:00:19.031
<c.fact>pulls back: we have been watching an iPad</c>

7
00:00:19.031 --> 00:00:21.957
<c.fact>on the Moon, the scratch is a crack,</c>

8
00:00:21.957 --> 00:00:24.680
<c.fact>and the hands are small and taped.</c>

9
00:00:24.987 --> 00:00:28.488
<c.fact>A robot outside her window wakes.</c>

10
00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:31.790
<c.fact>Each sheet he stamps wakes another.</c>

11
00:00:32.295 --> 00:00:35.093
<c.fact>Just before twenty minutes, he stamps Sheet</c>

12
00:00:35.093 --> 00:00:39.058
<c.fact>3 VOID, across the drawing of her window.</c>

13
00:00:39.449 --> 00:00:41.829
<c.fact>Then the stream peels off her screen,</c>

14
00:00:41.829 --> 00:00:45.783
<c.fact>and every robot turns its lights onto her window.</c>

15
00:00:47.062 --> 00:00:49.999
<c.steel>Teo draws at a desk on Earth, for people</c>

16
00:00:49.999 --> 00:00:53.471
<c.steel>on Earth; Aaron decided he never means the</c>

17
00:00:53.471 --> 00:00:56.182
<c.steel>stream to be watched from the base.</c>

18
00:00:56.569 --> 00:00:58.624
<c.fact>He gives every sheet away the minute</c>

19
00:00:58.624 --> 00:01:01.828
<c.fact>he stamps it: free; build whatever</c>

20
00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:03.123
<c.fact>you like with them.</c>

21
00:01:03.349 --> 00:01:05.718
<c.steel>Calm and matter-of-fact about every</c>

22
00:01:05.718 --> 00:01:09.189
<c.steel>risk, he is unintentionally brutal</c>

23
00:01:09.189 --> 00:01:11.633
<c.steel>to the girl watching.</c>

24
00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:13.322
<c.fact>He did not know she was</c>

25
00:01:13.322 --> 00:01:14.849
<c.fact>there until the call.</c>

26
00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:18.128
<c.running>And by our running rule, he is never the</c>

27
00:01:18.128 --> 00:01:22.221
<c.running>villain: his kindness is the weapon.</c>

28
00:01:23.512 --> 00:01:26.473
<c.steel>Aaron's brief: a child on a Moon</c>

29
00:01:26.473 --> 00:01:28.980
<c.steel>base, oddly alone among robots</c>

30
00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:30.879
<c.steel>that don't work correctly.</c>

31
00:01:31.186 --> 00:01:34.106
<c.steel>She is unheard for the first ten minutes;</c>

32
00:01:34.414 --> 00:01:37.369
<c.fact>her first sound is a cough.</c>

33
00:01:37.748 --> 00:01:40.639
<c.fact>The manifest lists thirteen adults,</c>

34
00:01:40.639 --> 00:01:43.246
<c.fact>and personal effects: one.</c>

35
00:01:43.657 --> 00:01:46.374
<c.running>By our running reading, she is that personal</c>

36
00:01:46.374 --> 00:01:50.258
<c.running>effect: the company never declared her.</c>

37
00:01:50.651 --> 00:01:52.218
<c.fact>They went to get the food,</c>

38
00:01:52.218 --> 00:01:54.993
<c.fact>she tells him. The lander tipped</c>

39
00:01:54.993 --> 00:01:58.424
<c.fact>over. That was eleven days ago.</c>

40
00:01:58.801 --> 00:02:00.844
<c.steel>This much Aaron has decided,</c>

41
00:02:00.844 --> 00:02:03.898
<c.steel>in steel: she is Rosie's granddaughter,</c>

42
00:02:03.898 --> 00:02:06.203
<c.steel>and Amara's daughter.</c>

43
00:02:07.484 --> 00:02:09.713
<c.steel>Teo's co-host on the call line,</c>

44
00:02:09.713 --> 00:02:13.730
<c.steel>Dez, is never seen. Aaron asked for a huge</c>

45
00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:16.389
<c.steel>tech nerd, promising a million people on</c>

46
00:02:16.389 --> 00:02:19.123
<c.steel>the Moon, who says Elon Musk a lot.</c>

47
00:02:19.431 --> 00:02:20.789
<c.fact>He says the full name every</c>

48
00:02:20.789 --> 00:02:24.267
<c.fact>time: twenty-four times.</c>

49
00:02:24.646 --> 00:02:28.263
<c.running>By our reading, his arc is not a redemption:</c>

50
00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:32.164
<c.running>mania, then the only silence of his life,</c>

51
00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:34.770
<c.fact>and then, quietly, the right</c>

52
00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:38.271
<c.fact>question: who do we call?</c>

53
00:02:39.547 --> 00:02:42.786
<c.fact>PAWN, her knee-high helper, sets thirteen</c>

54
00:02:42.786 --> 00:02:45.799
<c.fact>mugs and one small cup on the shelf,</c>

55
00:02:45.898 --> 00:02:50.014
<c.fact>and plays chess in Teo's chat, and cheats.</c>

56
00:02:50.413 --> 00:02:52.973
<c.fact>After the VOID it asks for a badge.</c>

57
00:02:53.165 --> 00:02:55.254
<c.fact>She holds up her mother's, and it is</c>

58
00:02:55.254 --> 00:02:57.460
<c.fact>reassigned to construction support.</c>

59
00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.312
<c.fact>On the call she says:</c>

60
00:02:59.573 --> 00:03:03.271
<c.fact>Pawn. He cheats. He left.</c>

61
00:03:03.625 --> 00:03:06.597
<c.egg>A chess machine that cheats and offers draws</c>

62
00:03:06.597 --> 00:03:08.896
<c.egg>keeps turning up after this night,</c>

63
00:03:08.896 --> 00:03:11.886
<c.egg>and nobody says it is the same one.</c>

64
00:03:13.177 --> 00:03:16.532
<c.fact>When her iPad dies, she charges it from her</c>

65
00:03:16.532 --> 00:03:20.166
<c.fact>suit, climbs for a signal, and against the</c>

66
00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:22.912
<c.fact>standing order, calls the stream.</c>

67
00:03:23.138 --> 00:03:25.542
<c.fact>Light takes one point two eight seconds</c>

68
00:03:25.542 --> 00:03:28.160
<c.fact>each way between Earth and the Moon,</c>

69
00:03:28.212 --> 00:03:30.174
<c.fact>so every answer comes after a</c>

70
00:03:30.174 --> 00:03:33.025
<c.fact>two-and-a-half-second silence.</c>

71
00:03:33.421 --> 00:03:35.186
<c.fact>Across those silences,</c>

72
00:03:35.186 --> 00:03:38.002
<c.fact>she tells him: I live in it.</c>

73
00:03:38.483 --> 00:03:41.351
<c.fact>Together they redraw Sheet 3, with her</c>

74
00:03:41.351 --> 00:03:44.543
<c.fact>window, her door in the floor, and a new</c>

75
00:03:44.543 --> 00:03:49.925
<c.fact>rule: no work on occupied modules, ever.</c>

76
00:03:50.321 --> 00:03:53.265
<c.fact>The robots' lights go out one by one.</c>

77
00:03:53.432 --> 00:03:56.103
<c.egg>And the gap comes back: two and a</c>

78
00:03:56.103 --> 00:03:58.587
<c.egg>half seconds of silence after Episode</c>

79
00:03:58.587 --> 00:04:00.352
<c.egg>3's unanswered question,</c>

80
00:04:00.352 --> 00:04:02.918
<c.egg>and a chess program in Episode 4</c>

81
00:04:02.918 --> 00:04:06.268
<c.egg>that answers exactly that late.</c>

82
00:04:07.547 --> 00:04:09.695
<c.fact>At six in the evening, the empty</c>

83
00:04:09.695 --> 00:04:12.302
<c.fact>HAB 1 intercom sends a message:</c>

84
00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:14.949
<c.fact>dinner, noor, with a heart.</c>

85
00:04:15.163 --> 00:04:16.765
<c.fact>It is the only place her</c>

86
00:04:16.765 --> 00:04:18.211
<c.fact>name is ever written.</c>

87
00:04:18.623 --> 00:04:20.376
<c.fact>She holds the talk key,</c>

88
00:04:20.376 --> 00:04:23.494
<c.fact>says nothing, and lets go.</c>

89
00:04:23.873 --> 00:04:27.560
<c.open>Who sends it is never said, and stays open.</c>

90
00:04:27.658 --> 00:04:30.816
<c.egg>In Episode 3 it is back, at the bottom</c>

91
00:04:30.816 --> 00:04:34.926
<c.egg>of a stranger's process list: dinner, noor,</c>

92
00:04:34.926 --> 00:04:37.823
<c.egg>daily, at eighteen hundred.</c>

93
00:04:39.113 --> 00:04:42.248
<c.egg>Episode 2 quotes the first night again and</c>

94
00:04:42.248 --> 00:04:44.813
<c.egg>again, and nobody on screen ever points</c>

95
00:04:44.813 --> 00:04:47.739
<c.egg>at it. Teo's study is the first night's</c>

96
00:04:47.739 --> 00:04:50.166
<c.egg>end room, about sixty years on:</c>

97
00:04:50.166 --> 00:04:52.680
<c.egg>the hat and the mask on his pinboard.</c>

98
00:04:52.883 --> 00:04:54.694
<c.egg>A print of Crimson Coil</c>

99
00:04:54.694 --> 00:04:57.103
<c.egg>hangs under his lamp.</c>

100
00:04:57.502 --> 00:05:00.683
<c.egg>An x-ray of the base warms one window to</c>

101
00:05:00.683 --> 00:05:04.219
<c.egg>the painted-out cabin's colour: hers.</c>

102
00:05:04.631 --> 00:05:07.765
<c.egg>And in the chat, grandma Rosie writes that</c>

103
00:05:07.765 --> 00:05:10.308
<c.egg>her big brother used to stay up all night,</c>

104
00:05:10.308 --> 00:05:13.402
<c.egg>painting along with a man on TV.</c>

105
00:05:14.702 --> 00:05:17.570
<c.open>Whether anyone comes back for her is open:</c>

106
00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:20.536
<c.open>the rover, the crew, her mother.</c>

107
00:05:20.762 --> 00:05:23.351
<c.open>So is whether the new drawing is enough:</c>

108
00:05:23.351 --> 00:05:25.743
<c.open>a hundred and thirty hours of battery,</c>

109
00:05:25.743 --> 00:05:28.791
<c.open>against a hundred and twenty-eight of night.</c>

110
00:05:29.173 --> 00:05:31.925
<c.open>And nobody knows whether Rosie knew that the</c>

111
00:05:31.925 --> 00:05:35.600
<c.open>girl on Teo's call was her granddaughter.</c>

112
00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:40.036
A man drew a city for strangers, and a child

113
00:05:40.036 --> 00:05:42.771
he never knew about checked his drawing.

114
00:05:43.183 --> 00:05:47.310
Next: a light comes on in an empty terminal.
